# ART-ALL12 -- W3-FIX-A art acceptance. ALL12 (SNOW, Moscow): St Basil's Cathedral (CARUS01, isogen.mix), the snow Kremlin palace and walls, and the two placed Terror Drones.
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL12S.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 400 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 30
cheat reveal
cheat art_dump
assert art.missing == 0
assert img.DRON >= 2
cheat view_building CARUS01
wait 2
shot basils
cheat view_building CARUS03
wait 2
shot kremlin
